      "text": "\u2022 Embarrassingly parallel\n  (zero communication)\n\n\u2022 Each scenario:\n  T stages \u00d7 1 LP = T solves\n\n\u2022 Dynamic balancing: fast\n  threads take more work\n\n\u2022 Perfect NUMA locality:\n  all data stays local",
